<title>MEXICO: Penoles to bid for three mining areas.</title>
<headline>Penoles to bid for three mining areas.</headline>
<dateline>GUADALAJARA, Mexico 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's Industrias Penoles S.A. intends to bid for three potential mining properties for sale in the western state of Jalisco, company director Jaime Lomeli said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;The Penoles group will be present in the bidding process for mining reserves in the zone, in the state of Jalisco,&quot; Lomeli said after meeting with Jalisco state Gov. Alberto Cardenas.</p>
<p>The Mexican government on Tuesday published details of 12 mining areas it intends to sell. Three of them are in the state of Jalisco.</p>
<p>((--Monica Ballesca, Guadalajara bureau +523 817-0397))</p>
